# Guest allowlist for oauth2-proxy: one Google (Gmail) address per line.
# Copy to emails.txt (gitignored) and fill in. oauth2-proxy hot-reloads it: add or remove a
# line to grant/revoke a guest, no restart. The REAL file must contain emails only, no
# comments (oauth2-proxy treats every non-empty line as an address).
# alice@example.com
# bob@example.com
